	</>

	<section label="4. Prose elements">
		<icon slot="icon" name="feather"/>
		<text paragraph>Blocks prose used to shape by hand. Each goes wherever prose goes: an item's text, a reply, an option card, a phase field.</>
		<table celled padding="compact" appearance="striped" unstackable>
			<row header>
				<cell>Tag</>
				<cell>Its role</>
			</>
			<row>
				<cell>
					<link target="src-packages-epics-docs-epic-net-effect-html" link="/epic-net-effect">
